// A bloat toad, the size of a pony: a swollen, warty hump, olive and
// mottled, gas venting from its back; a broad flat head, a gold eye with a
// slot of a pupil, a pale throat sac that swells (to croak, and before its
// tongue flies). It swells as it's hurt (fat, huge). Facing right; its
// tongue is drawn by custom/toad.rs from the `tongue` anchor.
(
    size: (52, 38),
    feet: (26, 38),
    outline: (24, 30, 14),
    palette: {
        'g': (110, 124, 60),    // skin
        'G': (150, 162, 84),    // skin, lit
